{
  "_comment": [
    "Hermes memory (mem0 OSS). Read this before changing a model id here.",
    "",
    "WHY BOTH llm AND embedder GO THROUGH THE PROXY, NOT AT A PROVIDER DIRECTLY.",
    "This file used to name provider models directly. On 2026-08-26 the gateway logged, on",
    "every single turn:  LLM extraction failed: Error code: 400 - gemini-flash-lite-latest",
    "is not a valid model ID.  The response was to DELETE the llm block, with a comment",
    "asserting 'no Google API key exists in this environment' and 'mem0 now runs",
    "embedding+Qdrant only (store/search works)'. Every part of that was wrong:",
    "  - GEMINI_API_KEY did exist, in ~/.config/ai-agent-stack/secrets.env, and on",
    "    2026-08-27 gemini-flash-lite-latest answered a live chat request in one call;",
    "  - removing the block did not degrade mem0, it KILLED it. mem0's oss loader reads",
    "    config['llm'] with a bare subscript, so the KeyError became a None backend and the",
    "    gateway logged 'Mem0 backend failed to initialize (oss mode): llm'. Store AND",
    "    search were dead, while this file claimed they worked.",
    "So the amputation was performed on a false diagnosis, and the real lesson is the",
    "original one: a hardcoded provider model id is a time bomb, because the id is retired,",
    "renamed or moved behind payment on the provider's schedule, not ours. 'auto' and",
    "'auto - Embedding' let llm-failover-proxy pick from a chain it validates per request.",
    "",
    "MANDATORY DETAILS, each of which was silently fatal at least once:",
    "1) vector_store must use host+port, NEVER 'path'. Embedded qdrant locks its folder, so",
    "   the second process to open it dies and mem0 never initializes — with no error.",
    "2) 'https': false is required. qdrant-client silently switches to HTTPS as soon as",
    "   api_key is set, and a plain-HTTP server then fails: SSL: WRONG_VERSION_NUMBER.",
    "3) embedding_dims is welded to the collection. hermes_mem0 is built at 3072; every",
    "   model in the proxy's Embedding list returns 3072 for exactly this reason. Changing",
    "   the dimension means a NEW collection — the backend DELETES a mismatched one.",
    "chmod 600: this file holds the Qdrant key and the local proxy key."
  ],
  "mode": "oss",
  "agent_id": "hermes",
  "oss": {
    "llm": {
      "provider": "openai",
      "config": {
        "model": "auto",
        "openai_base_url": "http://127.0.0.1:@AGENTIC_PORT@/v1",
        "api_key": "@REDACTED@"
      }
    },
    "embedder": {
      "provider": "openai",
      "config": {
        "model": "auto - Embedding",
        "embedding_dims": 3072,
        "openai_base_url": "http://127.0.0.1:@AGENTIC_PORT@/v1",
        "api_key": "@REDACTED@"
      }
    },
    "vector_store": {
      "provider": "qdrant",
      "config": {
        "collection_name": "hermes_mem0",
        "host": "127.0.0.1",
        "port": @QDRANT_HTTP_PORT@,
        "api_key": "zhrwKzx5SWFv5GDvtix-BEja4_18i4cKdxY7wzDjvqg",
        "https": false
      }
    }
  }
}
